    38	| **u1/clean-5** | The share appears in the description, not as the outcome’s “figure together with the share.” A loose reading might nevertheless apply the new sentence. | The outcome names multiple price series, years and rack cost; a no-main decline remains available. The description’s 25–30% is not a sound reason to select rack cost. |
    39	| **u1/clean-9** | The outcome names a share and its implied remainder, but not a total figure paired with a share. | **Yes:** the rolling 12-month figure has no stated publication day, so D417 independently requires decline. |
