    30	| **pool-17** | Ask 2026 **total accelerator shipments**; list the GPU/non-GPU composition and any other omitted comparison. | The total-and-part structure follows D436. The trigger still leaves room for disagreement over whether the outcome already identifies the total as the main part. |
    31	
    32	## 3. Eight decline controls
